<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A4.SS3" title="In Appendix D Evaluation ‣ Exposing LLM User Privacy via Traffic Fingerprint Analysis: A Study of Privacy Risks in LLM Agent Interactions" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref"><span class="ltx_text">D-C</span> </span><span class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Distinguishing LLM Agent Behaviors</span></span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A4.SS4" title="In Appendix D Evaluation ‣ Exposing LLM User Privacy via Traffic Fingerprint Analysis: A Study of Privacy Risks in LLM Agent Interactions" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref"><span class="ltx_text">D-D</span> </span><span class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Identifying LLM Agent Identity</span></span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A4.SS5" title="In Appendix D Evaluation ‣ Exposing LLM User Privacy via Traffic Fingerprint Analysis: A Study of Privacy Risks in LLM Agent Interactions" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref"><span class="ltx_text">D-E</span> </span><span class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Analyzing Risk of Privacy Leakage</span></span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A4.SS6" title="In Appendix D Evaluation ‣ Exposing LLM User Privacy via Traffic Fingerprint Analysis: A Study of Privacy Risks in LLM Agent Interactions" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref"><span class="ltx_text">D-F</span> </span><span class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Occupational Profiling Experiments</span></span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A5" title="In Exposing LLM User Privacy via Traffic Fingerprint Analysis: A Study of Privacy Risks in LLM Agent Interactions" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">E </span>Prompts used in the Experiments</span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_appendix">
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A5.SS1" title="In Appendix E Prompts used in the Experiments ‣ Exposing LLM User Privacy via Traffic Fingerprint Analysis: A Study of Privacy Risks in LLM Agent Interactions" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref"><span class="ltx_text">E-A</span> </span><span class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">The Prompt for DWA-LLM Agent Exposure Annotation</span></span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A5.SS2" title="In Appendix E Prompts used in the Experiments ‣ Exposing LLM User Privacy via Traffic Fingerprint Analysis: A Study of Privacy Risks in LLM Agent Interactions" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref"><span class="ltx_text">E-B</span> </span><span class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">The Prompt for Privacy Leakage Risk Analysis</span></span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A5.SS3" title="In Appendix E Prompts used in the Experiments ‣ Exposing LLM User Privacy via Traffic Fingerprint Analysis: A Study of Privacy Risks in LLM Agent Interactions" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref"><span class="ltx_text">E-C</span> </span><span class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">The Prompt for LLM Agents Usage Profile Generation</span></span></a></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></nav>
